Note on game assets: NMS Alphabet Translator is a fan-made two-way English
<-> NMS-glyph translator for No Man's Sky. This license covers the original
code, layout, and design in this project only.

The embedded "NMS Alphabet" font is not a Hello Games asset -- it's an
independent fan recreation of the in-game alien alphabet, built by
"seontonppa" using FontStruct (https://fontstruct.com), and used here with
the creator's direct permission. That permission and credit travels with the
font itself: its own embedded metadata reads "Copyright seontonppa 2022" and
links back to the original FontStruct page. Anyone wanting to reuse the font
specifically should get their own permission from seontonppa rather than
relying on this license, which does not extend to it.

Any other imagery sourced or adapted from No Man's Sky itself is the
property of Hello Games and is not covered by this license either -- it's
included here under fair-use fan-project conventions. Anyone reusing the
original code in this project should credit elegra1965 for that work.
